# Where the bake-off keeps its data on this host. The only place these paths are written down:
# tools take paths as arguments, and the shell entry points (make-report.sh, archive-graded.sh,
# HOURLY-CHECK.md commands) read them from here. Sourced by bash.
#
# Live area (SSD): the repo itself, its grade TSVs and report, and any case still running or
# not yet graded. Archive (NAS, RAID 1; operator 2026-10-07): every finished, graded case folder,
# the old result sets and session transcripts. evalbox cannot read the archive.
EVALS_REPO=/srv/bakeoff/model-bakeoff
EVALS_ARCHIVE=/srv/store/evals-archive
EVALS_ARCHIVE_RESULTS=$EVALS_ARCHIVE/model-bakeoff
EVALS_ARCHIVE_TRANSCRIPTS=$EVALS_ARCHIVE/transcripts
